Experiment 44: does the coverage disposer RANK the proposer's output?

physis: 730 entries, embedding...
hold-out: 657 known / 73 held out
proposals: 1638 near-neighbour midpoints (ranks 1-5)

records: 6234 operational events, embedding...
coverage: threshold 0.741 (median) — 2747/6234 records uncovered (44%)

planner-rule check: candidates rescuing >=1 record — p25 threshold 0.564: 98/1638, p50 (median) 0.741: 272/1638
ground truth: 217/1638 proposals are hits (base rate 0.132)

