(Read: COVERAGE arm > GEOMETRY arm at equal k means the operational signal adds
 ranking information the proposer's own geometry does not already carry — that is
 the composition working. Equal means the disposer filters but does not rank, and
 the worklist is worth reading only as a set, not in order.)
